{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36461","headline":"春夕寄友人时有与歌者南北 · 罗邺","name":"春夕寄友人时有与歌者南北","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳径春归花半开，碧山波暖雁初回。\n满楼月色还依旧，昨夜歌声自不来。\n愁眼向谁零玉筯，征蹄何处驻红埃？\n中宵吟罢正惆怅，从此兰堂锁绿苔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36461.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36461","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}